   "start": 9.047,
   "end": 9.898
  },
  {
   "text": "than the least attractive person.",
   "w0": 27,
   "w1": 31,
   "start": 9.898,
   "end": 11.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Researchers linked it",
   "w0": 32,
